00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:45.100
about them, which comes back to the reason we talked about it.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:45.980
Cause we saw it happening.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:47.180
It's happening more.

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:49.060
It's just very interesting.

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.140
Anyway, please continue.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:51.340
Yeah.

