And after that, I moved to Europe first.

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:57.210
I moved to Norway.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:01.650
I worked in a company that do video conferences, video

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.930
conferencing service that runs in the web.

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:08.410
It was kind of one of the first video conferences services that was using

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:13.810
WebRTC, which is an open source project by Google that run that you

00:12:13.810 --> 00:12:17.770
can do like web socket connection to the peer to peer video and audio

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:24.490
connection, which was a very interesting challenge because usually

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:28.570
when you were doing test automation, you were testing things with you

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:31.210
think about the end user perspective.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:34.450
You open a browser and you interact with the application as the

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:40.170
user, just with one browser in this company, we were opening lots of

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:45.240
